y  oversimplification way too much  and some of the best cyberpunk stories  are the ones that completely throw you  off in terms of what makes a person a  person  and it actually means that artificial  intelligence is our person's um it  actually means that  you can become part machine you can meld  with  systems and networks all of these  concepts are kind of going beyond what  we consider human  and i think that's where cyberpunk  actually becomes really interesting  [Music]  what could possibly go wrong  i'm actually one of the first  generations that have grown up with  video games i've been playing video  games  my whole life and i still do it and i  love it also i just love talking about  cyberpunk and science fiction so this  has been a blast  you
 

